NOTE ON DATA LICENSING

This MIT licence applies to the source code in this repository.

The accompanying DATA (curated plant reference database, family-level
abundance matrices, diet-composition tables, statistical outputs and sample
metadata) are released separately under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC-BY-4.0):
